# Datasets — large, git-ignored (see data/README.md for download URLs)
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# Generated figures — TRACKED as of 2026-08-06. They are regenerable (`python -m src.plots`),
# but the raw CSVs they derive from are not in the repo, so a collaborator or grader who clones
# cannot rebuild them without downloading the datasets first. The figures are also the graded
# artifact (the rubric scores the Results plots directly), so they ship with the repo.
# reports/figures/README.md is the captions + row-provenance sidecar, written by src.plots.
!reports/figures/.gitkeep

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Local Claude Code guidance — intentionally not shared with collaborators or graders.
# Anything a collaborator must not get wrong belongs in README.md instead.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Course handouts — the instructor's material, not ours to redistribute, and this repo
# goes public before 2026-08-16. Keep locally for reference; never commit.
AI_Sum26_ProjectDescription*.pdf
*ProjectDescription*.pdf

# Project proposal final, moved from the vault to the repo for convenience. Stays ignored:
# the approved proposal is the frozen text submitted to Canvas, and this repo goes public.
# `deviations.md` is the tracked, public-facing record of where the build departs from it.
Proposal-Final.md

